COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.scheduled_event_identifier IS 'Unique identifier for the scheduled event';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.owner_person_identifier IS 'The person that owns this event';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.source_system_identifier IS 'Unique identifier for the source system';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.name IS 'A name for the record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.description IS 'A description for the record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.status IS 'Status of the scheduled event (active, inactive)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.type IS 'Type of event: workshop, seminar, study session, etc.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.date IS 'Date for the scheduled event';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.start_time IS 'Start time for the scheduled event';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.end_date IS 'End date for the first occurrence of this event';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.end_time IS 'End time for the first occurrence of this event';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_indicator IS 'Does this event repeat?';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_end_type IS 'Does this repeating event never end, end after a number of occurrences, or on a date?';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_occurrences IS 'Number of occurrences of repeating event if the end type is occurrences';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_end_date IS 'End date of the repeating event if the end type is a date';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_frequency IS 'Frequency of repetition: daily, weekly, monthly or yearly';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_frequency_gap IS 'How many "skips" of frequency (e.g. every 3 days)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_frequency_type IS 'Frequency is either Ordinal or specific days/month';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_frequency_days_of_week IS 'Encoded string that represents selected days of the week for repeating events. Format is ''SMTWTFS'' where dashes in specific positions mean omission. (e.g. ''-M------'' means only Monday)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_frequency_days_of_month IS 'Comma delimited list of days of the month for monthly repeating events';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_frequency_month IS 'Comma delimited list of months for yearly repeating events';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_frequency_ordinal IS 'Ordinal frequency, from list of First, Second, Third, Fourth, Fifth, Last';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.repeat_frequency_ordinal_day IS 'Day determinant from list of Day, Weekday, Weekend Day, or day of month';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.location IS 'Location of the scheduled event';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.source_system_key_value IS 'Unique identifier of this record in the source system';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.source_system_created_date IS 'Date the record was created in the source system';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.source_system_updated_date IS 'Date the record was last updated in the source system';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.source_system_deleted_date IS 'Date the record was deleted from the source system';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.created_by IS 'Person identifier that created the record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.created_date IS 'Date and time record was created';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.updated_by IS 'Person identifier that updated the record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.updated_date IS 'Date and time record was updated';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.deleted_by IS 'Person identifier that deleted the record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN supports.scheduled_event.deleted_date IS 'Date and time record was deleted';

